WEBVTT

01:41.720 --> 01:46.800
FENGCAO PAVILION

01:59.560 --> 02:00.600
Physician!

02:05.000 --> 02:07.800
- Physician, she…
- My Lord,

02:07.880 --> 02:10.639
the Momai poison in Miss Mei Lin
was never truly neutralized.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.400
What did you say?

02:15.440 --> 02:17.840
When I took her pulse,

02:17.920 --> 02:20.440
I found her weakness
wasn't just from fatigue

02:20.520 --> 02:23.280
but because the poison
has eroded her heart.

02:23.360 --> 02:27.200
This time, she vomited blood and fainted,
clear signs of the poison's onset.

02:27.280 --> 02:29.040
She wished not to distract you, my Lord,

02:29.120 --> 02:33.120
vowing to tell you when the war ended.

03:04.160 --> 03:05.520
How foolish,

03:07.520 --> 03:09.520
always caring for others

03:09.600 --> 03:12.120
yet neglecting yourself.

03:15.600 --> 03:17.040
FENGCAO PAVILION

03:23.920 --> 03:24.840
Snow Dragon Whisker.

03:25.800 --> 03:26.880
Snow Dragon Whisker comes with the snow.

03:26.960 --> 03:29.160
If I find some, she will be saved.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.320
My Lord, there is none left.

03:31.400 --> 03:34.760
After the great fire in Qingzhou,
the Snow Dragon Whisker has perished.

06:19.800 --> 06:23.000
Your Highness, though our men
searched the snowy mountain,

06:23.080 --> 06:25.880
no Snow Dragon Whisker remains.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.920
Snow Dragon Whisker.

06:54.440 --> 06:55.280
Why?

06:57.240 --> 06:59.600
Why is it not the Snow Dragon Whisker?

07:05.840 --> 07:07.000
Your Excellency.

07:07.600 --> 07:09.600
Your Excellency, Miss Mei Lin is awake.

07:13.920 --> 07:16.120
FENGCAO PAVILION

07:16.200 --> 07:18.920
My Lord, I've suppressed the poison.

07:19.000 --> 07:21.840
She may endure but a month more.

07:21.920 --> 07:25.560
When she faints again, she won't awaken.

07:46.280 --> 07:47.120
Jinghe.

07:55.640 --> 07:56.480
Are you

07:57.840 --> 07:59.560
alright now?

08:04.840 --> 08:06.640
I feel great.

08:07.640 --> 08:10.360
Whatever the medicine may be,

08:10.440 --> 08:14.120
now, I feel better than before.

08:49.520 --> 08:51.680
I will find the Snow Dragon Whisker.

08:55.040 --> 08:56.960
I will find it.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.560
You will.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.960
Snow will come again.

09:10.680 --> 09:12.120
You will find it.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.440
It's my fault.

09:22.320 --> 09:25.080
I brought this harm to you.

09:25.680 --> 09:26.640
Jinghe.

09:35.640 --> 09:37.120
I forgave you long ago.

09:42.440 --> 09:44.800
The loss of the Snow Dragon Whisker
was merely fate.

09:45.600 --> 09:47.080
Since it has happened,

09:49.000 --> 09:50.800
don't use the past to torture yourself.

09:57.160 --> 09:58.160
I hid my condition,

10:00.320 --> 10:02.200
not only due to the war

10:03.840 --> 10:04.880
but also

10:08.440 --> 10:11.960
to save you from hurting yourself
because of me.

10:16.560 --> 10:18.440
I don't want you to blame yourself
or feel sad.

10:28.720 --> 10:30.600
I'm grateful

10:31.800 --> 10:33.440
for these moments by your side.

10:36.080 --> 10:37.880
If this ending

10:38.880 --> 10:40.280
is the price I have to pay

10:41.320 --> 10:43.320
for meeting you,

10:46.080 --> 10:47.640
I have no regrets.

11:42.680 --> 11:44.080
It's so tasty.

11:45.320 --> 11:46.400
Let me try it.

11:49.400 --> 11:51.040
- Jinghe.
- It's tasty.

11:53.240 --> 11:54.600
Don't keep a straight face.

11:54.680 --> 11:55.720
Smile a bit.

11:58.880 --> 12:01.360
Isn't it fun for you to shop with me?

12:03.040 --> 12:04.080
Smile again.

12:15.280 --> 12:17.560
I look tanned. This suits me better.
Your skin is lighter.

12:17.640 --> 12:19.000
It's the governor and Miss Hua.

12:19.080 --> 12:20.480
- His Excellency is here.
- The governor?

12:22.000 --> 12:22.920
Your Excellency.

12:23.000 --> 12:24.080
Your Excellency,

12:24.160 --> 12:26.800
try some home-grown sweet fruits.

12:26.880 --> 12:29.240
Miss Hua, please take this jade pendant.

12:29.320 --> 12:30.840
Your Excellency, my fruit cakes are sweet.

12:30.920 --> 12:33.120
Your Excellency, Miss Hua,
please come visit my store.

12:33.200 --> 12:34.560
Take whatever you like there.

12:35.920 --> 12:39.080
We appreciate your kind gesture,
but we can't accept your things.

12:39.160 --> 12:41.040
Your Excellency, you drove off
the Xiyan army for Qingzhou.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.440
We owe you thanks, Your Excellency.

12:42.520 --> 12:43.680
- Indeed, Your Excellency.
- Indeed, Your Excellency.

12:43.760 --> 12:45.720
These are but humble offerings.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.640
Indeed, Your Excellency. Please take them.

12:47.720 --> 12:48.560
Dear townsfolk--

12:49.360 --> 12:50.280
They are home-grown.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.280
Dear townsfolk,

12:52.040 --> 12:54.720
these two fruits
represent your kind gesture.

12:54.800 --> 12:55.960
We will take these.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.880
But we wish to stroll today.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.120
Please excuse us, dear townsfolk.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.600
Okay.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.440
Go ahead, Miss.

13:08.640 --> 13:09.760
- They look great together.
- Look.

13:09.840 --> 13:11.080
They look great together.

13:11.160 --> 13:12.000
They look lovely.

13:13.400 --> 13:14.760
Truly a fitting pair.

13:14.840 --> 13:16.120
A perfect match.

13:18.480 --> 13:19.680
Ten years ago,

13:19.760 --> 13:23.000
this was a barren land
with only a crumbling temple

13:23.760 --> 13:25.240
and beggars.

13:26.040 --> 13:28.840
Do you know that I cured
a blind beggar's eyes?

13:30.040 --> 13:31.280
How?

13:32.000 --> 13:35.920
I threw a stone into the bowl
he used for begging.

13:36.000 --> 13:36.840
He immediately opened his eyes.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.680
How did you know he was pretending?

13:41.520 --> 13:42.800
I noticed

13:43.520 --> 13:45.200
that when copper coins
were tossed into his bowl,

13:45.280 --> 13:47.600
he offered simple thanks,

13:48.360 --> 13:51.840
but when silver coins were given,
he would kowtow to the donor.

13:52.960 --> 13:58.120
Curious how he could gauge the amount
by sound alone,

13:58.880 --> 14:01.560
so I threw a stone,

14:01.640 --> 14:02.800
and he was exposed.

14:06.320 --> 14:07.160
How old were you then?

14:09.840 --> 14:10.680
I was 12.

14:14.200 --> 14:16.040
I wish I had seen you then.

14:19.280 --> 14:22.040
Qingzhou now is the finest I've ever seen.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.480
Jinghe,

14:25.160 --> 14:26.600
that's due to your efforts.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.440
Once,

14:30.520 --> 14:34.680
I watched Qingzhou burn,
corpses strewn across the land,

14:36.400 --> 14:38.880
and that vision haunted me.

14:39.480 --> 14:44.320
I couldn't understand why one command
could bring ruin upon innocents.

14:48.920 --> 14:50.560
However, after Qingzhou's recent trials,

14:53.080 --> 14:56.640
I realized that a single order
can also shield many lives.

14:59.000 --> 15:02.600
Jinghe, your Weibei Army and you

15:02.680 --> 15:05.240
safeguarded Qingzhou and its people.

15:12.240 --> 15:15.520
I once thought joining
the army meant fighting,

15:16.320 --> 15:19.120
defending the country
meant winning battles.

15:20.360 --> 15:21.560
Now, I see

15:22.120 --> 15:25.480
the Weibei Army guards not just a city

15:25.560 --> 15:28.840
but the lives on this land.

15:33.520 --> 15:34.960
So,

15:35.040 --> 15:36.520
you'll continue

15:37.920 --> 15:40.040
to protect them

15:41.000 --> 15:42.280
and Qingzhou,

15:44.400 --> 15:45.440
right?

15:53.800 --> 15:55.680
Yet Murong Jinghe

15:57.200 --> 15:59.480
cannot shield Mei Lin.

16:17.560 --> 16:18.960
Murong Jinghe,

16:25.400 --> 16:27.800
you don't live to protect Mei Lin alone.

16:28.480 --> 16:29.720
You live

16:31.160 --> 16:33.440
to protect millions of people
like Mei Lin.

16:42.560 --> 16:44.200
You're not allowed to cry.

16:46.080 --> 16:47.160
No more tears.

16:51.720 --> 16:53.240
Smile.

16:54.680 --> 16:56.240
I like to see you smile.

16:58.240 --> 17:00.040
I want to keep that smile in my memory.

17:01.200 --> 17:02.040
Smile.

17:09.000 --> 17:10.960
Do you still wish to be
my live-in husband?

17:18.560 --> 17:19.960
Let's marry.

17:49.560 --> 17:50.520
Officer Li.

17:51.480 --> 17:52.360
What can I do for you, Your Excellency?

17:53.480 --> 17:55.800
Are the lovebirds ready for the betrothal?

17:55.880 --> 17:57.080
By Qingzhou custom,

17:57.160 --> 17:59.400
the betrothal gifts are all prepared.

17:59.480 --> 18:00.640
When the townsfolk heard
of Your Excellency's plans,

18:00.720 --> 18:02.080
they offered many gifts,

18:02.160 --> 18:05.200
filling the governor's mansion
and cake shops.

18:06.720 --> 18:09.320
The war has just ended.
The people should not be disturbed.

18:09.400 --> 18:11.480
Return their gifts.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.400
Fear not, Your Excellency.

18:12.480 --> 18:14.600
The offerings are humble gifts
from the countryside,

18:14.680 --> 18:16.680
a sign of the townsfolk's blessings

18:17.200 --> 18:20.480
for Your Excellency and Miss Hua,
wishing you both joy.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.400
Good to hear.

18:24.960 --> 18:27.080
She must be anxious.

18:27.680 --> 18:29.560
- I should see her.
- Your Excellency,

18:30.160 --> 18:32.120
have you forgotten today's significance?

18:41.280 --> 18:43.080
In the 26th Year of Zhaoming,

18:43.160 --> 18:46.680
Great Yan forged the Qingzhou Treaty

18:46.760 --> 18:48.800
with Xiyan,

18:48.880 --> 18:51.880
pledging mutual respect for borders
and vowing non-aggression.

18:52.560 --> 18:56.680
For a century,
three emperors upheld this pact,

18:56.760 --> 18:59.560
maintaining peace between the realms.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.280
I still owe you gratitude
for saving my life.

19:03.160 --> 19:06.600
I did it for Qingzhou, not you.

19:08.640 --> 19:09.640
By the way,

19:10.680 --> 19:14.800
I've heard Your Excellency
will wed in two days. Congratulations.

19:16.640 --> 19:17.920
Thank you.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.280
This

19:25.560 --> 19:26.640
is from Concubine Yan.

19:26.720 --> 19:28.120
She kept it for you.

19:43.960 --> 19:45.080
Brother,

19:46.200 --> 19:47.040
I know

19:47.920 --> 19:50.320
you now bear the title of Prince Heir,

19:50.400 --> 19:53.360
bound by heavy duties.

19:53.440 --> 19:55.280
You are not just my brother now,

19:56.720 --> 19:59.240
so you can't come to see me.

20:00.920 --> 20:02.160
I don't blame you.

20:03.160 --> 20:06.080
Am I sensible now?

20:07.120 --> 20:08.120
Brother,

20:09.600 --> 20:11.040
are you weary?

20:13.200 --> 20:15.920
If so, have some bamboo brew.

20:22.200 --> 20:25.320
When you become the king,

20:26.120 --> 20:27.920
come to Zhaojing to see me.

20:31.400 --> 20:33.040
I'll be waiting.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.200
Also,

20:38.600 --> 20:39.720
I dreamed of you.

20:41.320 --> 20:44.560
In the dream, you carved
a grand hobbyhorse for the little prince.

20:46.640 --> 20:48.080
Not to rush you.

20:50.800 --> 20:52.120
I simply

20:55.760 --> 20:56.600
miss you.

21:51.800 --> 21:54.440
My dear, you are ever the sweetest.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.680
Your Excellency, Qingzhou tradition says

22:21.760 --> 22:24.040
newlyweds shouldn't meet
the day before the wedding.

22:24.640 --> 22:26.360
Does this apply
to live-in husbands as well?

22:26.440 --> 22:29.400
Yes, Your Excellency.
Mei awaits you tomorrow.

22:38.040 --> 22:40.160
FENGCAO PAVILION

22:47.960 --> 22:50.760
His Excellency can't bear to part
with Mei for a second.

22:50.840 --> 22:52.200
What did he say?

22:52.280 --> 22:54.680
Only that His Excellency
longs to see his bride.

22:56.600 --> 22:58.920
These formalities are unnecessary.

22:59.000 --> 23:01.200
In Qingzhou, the ritual is simple.

23:01.280 --> 23:02.800
One places a wooden stick on the door

23:02.880 --> 23:05.280
and shares a meal with neighbors.
That's all.

23:05.360 --> 23:06.440
A wedding should not be simple.

23:06.520 --> 23:07.480
It's a once-in-a-lifetime occasion,

23:07.560 --> 23:09.760
- deserving grandeur.
- Yes.

23:10.440 --> 23:12.000
Yi, when it's your turn to marry,

23:12.080 --> 23:13.160
we'll throw you a grand wedding.

23:13.840 --> 23:14.760
I won't marry.

23:14.840 --> 23:17.040
I'll stay at the spice house.
You will support me forever.

23:17.120 --> 23:18.360
In your dreams!

23:19.120 --> 23:21.240
If you won't, Mei will.

23:21.320 --> 23:22.160
Mei,

23:22.240 --> 23:24.800
I'm getting better
at making Dengguo cakes.

23:25.480 --> 23:27.680
The cake shop now has a live-in husband
and won't need your help.

23:27.760 --> 23:30.360
You should stay at the spice house.

23:30.440 --> 23:32.200
Jinghe can only audit accounts.

23:32.280 --> 23:35.600
If he bakes, my shop will close.

23:36.880 --> 23:38.920
I'm counting on you for my cake shop, Yi.

23:39.000 --> 23:40.080
Certainly.

23:41.440 --> 23:42.760
Look how smug you are.

23:44.720 --> 23:45.960
Mei, teach me.

23:46.040 --> 23:47.560
- Teach me too.
- Okay.

23:47.640 --> 23:48.600
Start from here.

23:49.320 --> 23:52.280
- And then do this.
- Look, the pattern you cut is crooked.

23:53.640 --> 23:56.680
ESCORT TEAM

24:01.800 --> 24:02.960
Look. A couple is being wed.

24:03.040 --> 24:03.880
Really?

24:03.960 --> 24:04.960
The bridal sedan.

24:05.040 --> 24:06.320
Look at the big bridal sedan.

24:07.080 --> 24:07.960
Look at that.

24:08.040 --> 24:09.280
Is that the governor?

24:10.200 --> 24:11.240
Are you seeing things?

24:11.320 --> 24:13.120
Why would the governor
be in the bridal sedan?

24:13.200 --> 24:14.760
That's the governor.

24:14.840 --> 24:15.840
Didn't you know?

24:15.920 --> 24:19.080
Today is His Excellency's big day
to become a live-in husband.

24:20.760 --> 24:23.280
His Excellency's way
is certainly different from ours.

24:24.160 --> 24:26.560
Do you think these are betrothal gifts

24:26.640 --> 24:27.840
or a dowry?

24:35.360 --> 24:37.440
Here they come.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.640
Is this color too bright for me?

24:45.720 --> 24:46.880
You always dress plainly.

24:46.960 --> 24:48.160
You should stand out today.

24:48.240 --> 24:49.160
It's perfect. You look nice.

24:49.240 --> 24:52.280
GOVERNOR'S MANSION

24:53.360 --> 24:54.760
Great.

24:54.840 --> 24:56.080
ESCORT TEAM

24:56.160 --> 24:59.000
Great.

25:10.160 --> 25:12.360
Welcome the groom!

25:13.080 --> 25:14.160
Miss.

25:31.320 --> 25:32.440
Let's make a bet.

25:33.320 --> 25:35.440
If I can grow Red Fruits,

25:36.040 --> 25:36.880
you will marry me.

25:38.640 --> 25:39.480
I won't bet.

25:40.360 --> 25:42.760
I won't be married off.
I'll just take a live-in husband.

26:41.800 --> 26:45.080
Bow to each other.

27:53.000 --> 27:55.280
- The ceremony is complete.
- Great.

27:55.360 --> 27:58.520
Escort the groom to the bridal room.

28:00.760 --> 28:03.800
Your Excellency,
please enter the bridal room.

28:06.960 --> 28:09.480
Great.

28:09.560 --> 28:11.600
Great.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.560
Go back and wait for me.

28:14.440 --> 28:15.280
Don't drink too much.

28:22.000 --> 28:22.840
Jinghe.

28:29.360 --> 28:30.200
Let's drink together.

28:31.240 --> 28:33.200
Okay.

28:34.560 --> 28:35.640
Let's drink together.

28:35.720 --> 28:37.040
Okay.

28:38.720 --> 28:39.760
Bottoms up.

28:40.680 --> 28:41.680
Cheers.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.360
Delicious.

28:45.040 --> 28:45.880
More.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.960
The stars shine so bright tonight.

28:50.200 --> 28:51.280
Father,

28:55.080 --> 28:55.920
Mother,

28:58.280 --> 28:59.920
are you watching over me?

29:05.080 --> 29:06.800
I got married today.

29:12.720 --> 29:14.560
Rest assured. Even if you marry,

29:14.640 --> 29:17.880
your father and I
would never let you be mistreated.

29:32.880 --> 29:34.040
Father,

29:35.320 --> 29:36.160
Mother,

29:37.960 --> 29:41.640
I swear to care for Mei.

29:53.880 --> 29:55.120
Big Guy,

29:55.880 --> 29:57.920
Mei is married today.

29:58.520 --> 30:00.520
You must have seen it, right?

30:04.680 --> 30:07.440
Big Guy, I miss you.

30:08.160 --> 30:10.240
I miss your Dengguo wine.

30:12.720 --> 30:14.400
Wei will see it.

30:17.560 --> 30:19.920
Wei, don't worry.

30:20.480 --> 30:22.400
I'll always stay by Jia's side.

30:23.320 --> 30:27.000
She won't be alone with me here.

30:40.880 --> 30:41.840
Wei,

30:44.080 --> 30:46.880
Qingyan, and Your Highness,

30:47.800 --> 30:49.160
we all think of you.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.680
You must be pleased

30:52.280 --> 30:56.200
to see harmony and joy on earth.

30:58.360 --> 30:59.480
They are.

31:29.400 --> 31:32.480
You had a bit too much to drink tonight.

31:41.080 --> 31:43.320
I only drank a little.

31:50.200 --> 31:51.480
You just married into my family.

31:51.560 --> 31:52.800
You've started to discipline me.

31:54.480 --> 31:56.200
I wouldn't dare discipline.

31:56.280 --> 31:58.520
I'm but a live-in husband.

31:59.320 --> 32:01.240
None would dare discipline his wife.

32:15.880 --> 32:16.960
Jinghe.

32:21.000 --> 32:22.360
You look quite dashing.

32:24.440 --> 32:26.440
Not as much as my beloved wife.

33:33.120 --> 33:34.240
Zigu,

33:38.720 --> 33:40.680
it's snowing in the capital.

33:44.240 --> 33:48.000
In Xiyan, it must snow too.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.960
I will send you

33:55.640 --> 33:57.240
home.

34:54.000 --> 34:55.719
You can't bear to leave me.

34:59.720 --> 35:00.840
Okay.

35:01.920 --> 35:03.480
You don't need to leave.

35:03.560 --> 35:05.240
You don't need to leave.

35:05.800 --> 35:08.520
I too cannot bear parting.

35:29.240 --> 35:34.560
WAN'AN HALL

35:35.520 --> 35:37.600
We've reclaimed Youwen Ridge.

35:37.680 --> 35:40.680
We can now build a road
between Qingzhou and Mozhou,

35:41.520 --> 35:43.280
easing travel for all.

35:45.160 --> 35:50.280
MEMORIAL TABLET OF DECEASED HUSBAND
MURONG XUANLIE

35:51.600 --> 35:55.200
It's forbidden to drink here,
so I'll raise water as wine.

35:57.640 --> 35:59.440
It's been long since we drank together.

36:16.520 --> 36:18.320
Do you never think of me?

36:20.280 --> 36:22.000
Or want me to forget you?

36:24.920 --> 36:27.000
Why never visit me in my dreams?

36:29.360 --> 36:30.400
But know this,

36:32.760 --> 36:33.880
I don't want to forget you.

36:39.080 --> 36:40.000
Return

36:42.280 --> 36:43.640
and see me once more.

36:49.240 --> 36:50.600
I order you…

36:57.800 --> 36:59.520
to come back.

37:20.840 --> 37:22.000
Are you done gazing at me?

37:23.600 --> 37:25.080
I could never tire

37:26.440 --> 37:28.160
of watching my beloved.

39:19.480 --> 39:25.320
FENGCAO PAVILION

40:02.960 --> 40:03.920
The clothes are ready.

40:08.720 --> 40:10.480
I have one condition.

40:14.200 --> 40:15.680
Give me another painting.

41:04.120 --> 41:05.560
It's snowing.

41:51.240 --> 41:52.400
Jinghe,

41:59.440 --> 42:01.480
I have but one wish.

42:12.520 --> 42:13.840
May you

42:17.200 --> 42:19.240
live well

42:23.000 --> 42:24.840
and long.

42:34.360 --> 42:35.640
Jinghe,

42:38.880 --> 42:40.120
I will

42:41.160 --> 42:42.520
always,

42:44.040 --> 42:45.080
always

42:47.200 --> 42:49.560
be with you.

42:50.640 --> 42:52.600
When you miss me,

42:58.360 --> 43:00.160
just call out.

43:18.280 --> 43:21.240
I will hear you.

44:13.400 --> 44:14.440
Jinghe,

44:16.240 --> 44:18.360
if not for the fire in Qingzhou,

44:19.680 --> 44:23.480
how would we have met?

44:25.120 --> 44:26.600
The sun would've shone bright

44:27.600 --> 44:28.920
that day.

44:33.760 --> 44:35.320
- General!
- General Weibei!

44:35.400 --> 44:37.120
General Weibei!

44:37.920 --> 44:40.800
General is back.

44:41.880 --> 44:43.400
General!

44:44.080 --> 44:46.080
General Weibei.

44:46.160 --> 44:47.160
General!

44:47.240 --> 44:48.080
General!

44:48.160 --> 44:49.760
General Weibei!

44:49.840 --> 44:52.760
General!

44:52.840 --> 44:53.880
General!

44:53.960 --> 44:56.240
- General Weibei!
- General is mighty!

45:10.440 --> 45:13.600
SPRING FLOWER CAKE SHOP

45:27.000 --> 45:29.080
I never saw what General Weibei
looked like.

45:31.080 --> 45:32.720
Does he look fierce?

45:34.560 --> 45:35.440
Does he have a mustache?

45:36.120 --> 45:38.600
General, we won the fight.

45:38.680 --> 45:40.040
When will you wed?

45:40.120 --> 45:41.840
The brothers await the wedding wine.

45:41.920 --> 45:43.520
Who says I'll wed?

45:43.600 --> 45:44.440
Stop pretending.

45:44.520 --> 45:47.480
I've heard you promised the Empress

45:47.560 --> 45:49.400
you'd return to the capital and wed
after defeating Xiyan.

45:49.480 --> 45:51.760
I only said that to appease my mother.

45:51.840 --> 45:53.320
I won't get married.

45:53.400 --> 45:54.520
Marriage has no appeal to me.

45:56.880 --> 45:58.160
Forget if he's mustached or not.

45:58.240 --> 45:59.800
Remember this.

46:00.400 --> 46:02.920
He's Qingzhou's great hero,
and that is enough.

46:03.000 --> 46:03.880
Come now. Stop playing that.

46:03.960 --> 46:05.360
We've fruit cakes to deliver.

46:05.440 --> 46:06.920
- Hurry.
- A great hero?

46:07.000 --> 46:07.880
Yes.

46:10.320 --> 46:12.440
Mother, I wish to join the army,

46:13.440 --> 46:15.960
to battle like General Weibei!

46:16.600 --> 46:19.040
The battle will claim your life.

46:19.120 --> 46:20.160
This isn't a game.

46:20.240 --> 46:21.760
Cease your nonsense and get to work.

46:21.840 --> 46:23.240
I'm unafraid!

46:23.320 --> 46:25.280
But Liu Dajiang says
marriage is wonderful.

46:25.880 --> 46:29.240
He even trains with such vigor now.

46:29.320 --> 46:31.640
I caught him secretly shedding tears
at home the other day.

46:32.360 --> 46:33.520
What do you know?

46:33.600 --> 46:34.880
When a woman worries,

46:34.960 --> 46:36.480
it's more troublesome
than a mother's scolding.

46:37.160 --> 46:40.000
Moreover, we are men.

46:40.080 --> 46:43.520
How can we be bound by fleeting emotions?

46:43.600 --> 46:46.840
Wild girl, you're untamed and fearless.

46:46.920 --> 46:48.160
Who would marry you?

46:49.160 --> 46:52.320
- You'll remain home forever.
- So what if no one marries me?

46:52.400 --> 46:55.160
I'll have Father find me
a live-in husband!

46:58.920 --> 47:01.160
Good idea.

47:01.800 --> 47:04.080
Mother, your stone hairpin
as the dowry then?

47:04.760 --> 47:06.200
Give it back!

47:06.280 --> 47:07.840
Crazy girl, give it back to me!

47:07.920 --> 47:10.000
I will tell my mother I'm only…

47:46.600 --> 47:49.080
Miss, your stone hairpin.

48:03.720 --> 48:05.840
Even if the Qingzhou fire hadn't happened,

48:07.600 --> 48:08.600
fate

48:10.920 --> 48:12.720
would eventually bring us together.

48:32.880 --> 48:37.440
THE END

48:58.520 --> 49:00.520
In the 29th year of Zhaoming,

49:00.600 --> 49:03.000
Emperor Murong Qian abdicated.

49:03.080 --> 49:04.960
Murong Jinghe ascended the throne,

49:05.040 --> 49:06.920
taking the era name Zhenyuan.

49:11.600 --> 49:13.720
In Murong Jinghe's decade-long reign,

49:13.800 --> 49:15.200
he appointed the wise and diligent,

49:15.280 --> 49:17.120
bringing prosperity to Yan.

49:17.200 --> 49:19.840
The Yan Dynasty grew stronger,

49:20.400 --> 49:24.360
the economy thrived,
and the people enjoyed peace,

49:24.440 --> 49:27.400
known as the Prosperous Zhenyuan Era.

49:46.040 --> 49:48.600
ZHENYUAN ERA, YEAR 10

49:48.680 --> 49:53.320
FENGCAO PAVILION

51:10.040 --> 51:12.240
His Majesty now inspects Qingzhou,

51:12.320 --> 51:14.040
sitting daily to admire the view.

51:14.760 --> 51:17.880
Is this Red Fruit tree truly so lovely?

51:18.520 --> 51:19.880
He gazes at the tree,
but his thoughts drift elsewhere.

51:20.720 --> 51:25.120
His Majesty planted it together
with the late Empress.

51:25.200 --> 51:27.720
What kind of woman was the late Empress?

51:27.800 --> 51:30.640
For her, His Majesty keeps no harem,

51:30.720 --> 51:32.040
appointing his nephew as Crown Prince.

51:32.720 --> 51:35.280
She was indeed exceptional.

51:35.360 --> 51:37.440
They say His Majesty was once
her live-in husband.

51:37.520 --> 51:38.680
Is that so?

51:48.400 --> 51:49.480
Mei Lin,

51:52.560 --> 51:55.160
at last, we meet again.

52:27.200 --> 52:28.080
Your Majesty!

52:28.160 --> 52:29.240
Your Majesty!

52:32.560 --> 52:33.960
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty!

52:34.040 --> 52:34.880
Your Majesty.

52:35.800 --> 52:37.080
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

52:37.160 --> 52:38.160
Your Majesty.

52:39.680 --> 52:40.520
Your Majesty!

52:40.600 --> 52:41.880
Your Majesty.

52:45.040 --> 52:46.120
Your Majesty.

52:46.200 --> 52:47.040
Your Majesty.

52:47.640 --> 52:49.080
Your Majesty.
